- # Frontend Architecture

- Follow layered structure: `src/app`, `src/core`, `src/components`, `src/features`, `src/pages`.
- Enforce dependency flow: utils/schemas → services → hooks → contexts → components/pages. No React in services/utils.
- Use TanStack Query for server data, Zustand stores for client state. Avoid global state unless shared.
- Use typed API clients in `packages/config/api` or `packages/services/http`; avoid raw fetch.
- Use Tailwind and `packages/styles`; prefer existing UI primitives under `src/components/ui`.
- Type all exported APIs; avoid `any`. Fix lint issues per `Client/config` rules.
- Keep tokens in memory and sessionStorage only; never localStorage.
- Use scripts: dev, build, test, test:e2e, lint, format.
